{"version":1,"key":"card:624","content":{"id":624,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"461bb55c-2aab-45a7-90ba-4090123f48ea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络效应（Network Effect） 也称为网络外部性（Network Externality），是指"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#245bdb","darkColor":"#70a0ff","text":"一个产品或服务的价值随着使用的用户的增加而增加的现象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"81e7d089-ce6c-4b93-9b28-5bb1ea4ea8a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以通信系统为例，如果世界上只有一台电话，那么这台电话毫无价值。如果有两台，两个人之间可以通话，那么还有点用，但是因为只能互相联系到对方，因此价值有限。但还如果有更多的电话，有更多的人加入到这个通信系统，这些人之间可以互相通信，那么每天电话的价值都非常高，电话价值随着用户数的增多而增长。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e132ace7-a3f2-4bbc-89cb-473650c7a03e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络效应的特点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"fd856302-7f07-4259-a796-e213cf666736","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"ffd45043-1530-480e-8056-b114fc6ecf0c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d7c4e0d9-3141-44ef-b8a7-2b1a3723b33a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正反馈循环，更多用户 -> 更大价值 -> 吸引更多用户 -> 价值进一步提升"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b1fb7d9e-6402-42b8-86b5-43526f628c8b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b6f12a48-5f9d-4581-acf1-dc89c2757a63","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"指数增长：产品的价值往往是随着用户数呈指数增长的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"5c56787d-c0ba-41cf-9aa9-3355ffee987f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"30fc4285-9102-4a50-9394-6407a798fa85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"赢家通吃：一旦达到临界规模，会迅速占据市场主导地位，竞争对手难以超越"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"76b1ddbf-e7bf-4169-87b3-74d751cebbf9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"55a1be04-f5fd-486c-ae84-070a325d2a1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"高成本转换：用户一旦加入一个网络，由于个人数据、社交关系、学习成本等原因，难以切换到另一个网络"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"f3716c57-63b0-462a-bf92-990b588a016b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络效应的分类："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"57de51d7-ae48-4f9a-b1cb-4696c22aa762","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4f3c05a8-75bd-4f58-bc97-c78ae6b02ae0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9ce7ee8c-b9c4-4dbd-9b00-fbcede01c272","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接网络效应"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"1efa4eeb-d626-4e6c-aaf9-f220f96fbe4a","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2a41141d-49c7-4dbc-a13c-6e5f7d6111da","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6bff9fb8-c786-4164-b0b1-7c43a7f5346c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产品价值随着"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"同一类型用户"},{"type":"formatted","text":"数量的增加而增加"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"bae47281-0ed3-41e5-a119-b358ec4ef2a2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"d227e9e4-78a0-499c-9365-f91e609bb6a1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"6bf0697c-901d-49fc-b5ad-9b9a778e08f6","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"43008ec4-8b39-4df4-86eb-439b9ba055e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"4a0bb209-0c4e-4ddd-ba0a-83a9f1341970","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"社交媒体（微信、Facebook、Twitter、Bilibili、Youtube）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fa85fc30-036a-4b44-88ae-3c61bb7e372d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"89fa8128-45dc-4e65-9e0b-5ed80d9a2627","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"游戏平台，玩的人越多，越容易找到队友或对手（王者荣耀、英雄联盟、永劫无间）"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"2ac46706-2d67-4fe5-8710-3c7ed50b48fc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"bded9b70-0ffb-462c-843f-4737f5d67f75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"间接网络效应"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"7af5a7bb-7f0a-4c01-a9f9-a018c6b60b5e","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"381cfc38-a313-452b-a74b-0ea08cf4ab5d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"9fd870fe-75da-4cfb-a0d6-f2af920a8292","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产品价值通过吸引"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873","text":"不同类型的用户"},{"type":"formatted","text":"群体而增加，常发生于多边平台"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f0c10c13-3e16-4216-a1e2-cc487a2aa74c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"eab9e389-dbf9-4820-bd68-22dafd7ee59f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"e011569a-f7d5-401d-bae7-04881b7253d7","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f832e332-5057-4293-b03d-424cb07ed233","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"981aa203-2f86-450f-8fee-7e9424213bcd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"操作系统，使用的用户越多 -> 吸引到更多开发者 -> 更多应用使得操作系统更具价值，吸引更多用户"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"94b0c4e6-a21e-4acf-8588-199e4540c320","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"e46ac344-d802-4ec4-aa49-df65f5e7c2a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"电商平台，更多买家 -> 吸引更多商家入驻 -> 更多商品吸引更多买家"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"fb737c0d-b06d-4de9-9dbc-af60d9a375c3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"41edd1b6-74c5-4280-960e-d887ef3f1766","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"打车平台，更多乘客 -> 吸引更多司机 -> 缩短等车时间，吸引更多用户"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"294d95ce-101f-4d53-a5cf-11638d49b814","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"de865af2-6de9-46ab-a3f1-222a01b61b30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"本地网络效应"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"2305d0cd-d6d4-499a-87c5-baa593eb7f97","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f76c8766-a09b-41f1-938e-45b659133f7e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"5322dc6d-c372-4648-85c1-2ef7555e34f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"产品价值取决于用户直接连接或地理位置相近的用户量，而不是所有用户量"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"4173a3d2-b2d8-413c-a0e2-060dfb0158ea","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"3a8f22af-1e03-4902-9bad-98ecc9e3e24f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"61adaea2-87e8-4e2c-bb0b-e66d086fff59","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"f08947a8-9179-4bdc-b5b6-cc501f86af7f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2671c933-2c55-4539-a8d2-be9b3715e334","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"共享单车，所在区域存在足够多的共享单车你才会使用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"b33a502c-faa0-4ff0-ba7d-d511f3cdef95","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6e70f5f0-8407-407e-8d20-23575ccfb071","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"邻里社交，取决于邻居们是否在使用"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"a6237e1e-3de7-49e3-b74d-2d03012b770a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"29c6db61-d9a2-4b01-815b-f6ed0d35dced","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据网络效应"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"4bbf4b4e-a283-4237-b4fe-09a499a9d19e","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"641a1b2e-3687-491a-8c15-e057546f6d05","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"a540446d-5f6e-4c64-8a2c-ecd703df9e00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随着用户的增加，收集到更多的数据，数据反过来改进产品，使得产品更具价值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"82642b43-c4c5-4dd3-ade0-b0d9cba841f2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"6cf0db89-ef22-4d1f-a6c3-6af206467b4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例子"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","collabId":"7e237576-71eb-4a6e-8df8-0b92dc217bca","children":[{"type":"list-item","collabId":"8f13bf33-f8da-4417-b90b-00f9afbf5751","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"b59b9751-217e-4426-a054-9fce9c6d01d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"推荐系统，如今日头条、抖音、Netflix、淘宝"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","collabId":"0383b172-57c9-4441-b016-f9fe238395e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"12a9fe0f-6e05-47fd-9b3b-38b519f641ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"AI 产品，如 ChatGPT、Gemini"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["网络效应"],"createTime":1757900255463,"updateTime":1788910912017,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1788910912017}}